{"articleNo":"98785","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=98785&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] (사)문화창작집단 공터_다 정기 공연 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.01.17","hit":"11769","attachments":[{"name":"다리에서바라본풍경.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=98785&attachNo=22811"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">예술과 함께 꿈꾸는 행복한 세상만들기, 아름다운 대학문화환경 조성을 위한 연극 공연을 소개합니다.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">1. 공 연 명 : <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; COLOR: #ff00cc; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">다리</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">에서 바라본 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; COLOR: #ff0099; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">풍경</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; COLOR: #ff0099; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">2. 작품 소개 : 끊임없이 선택과 타협의 기로에 놓이게 되는 우리들의 인생사</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">3. 일&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 시 : <span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2014. 1. 16(목) ~ 25(토)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;평일 오후 8시, 토 오후 3시, 7시 / 일 오후 3시</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">4. 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : <span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">소극장 [공터_다]</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">5. 기&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 타 : 금오공대 학생증 제시시 <span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\">5,000원 할인(현장할인)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[협력기관 문화협약 체결]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">6. 주&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 관 : (사) 문화창작집단(공터-다)</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">7. 티켓가격 : 일반 20,000원 (※붙임 포스터 참고)</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">8. 공연 및 티켓 문의 : 054. 444. 0604</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">붙임&nbsp;&nbsp; 다리에서 바라본 풍경 포스터 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;2014.&nbsp; 1.&nbsp; 17</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학생처장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
